sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Author
    participant UI as Blog UI (React)
    participant CF as CloudFront + edge function
    participant API as Blog API (Lambda)
    participant DB as Posts (DynamoDB)

    Author->>UI: Open blog.sachin-kale.com/new
    UI->>CF: GET /new
    CF-->>UI: /index.html from S3 (SPA fallback)

    Author->>UI: Fill in title, author, Markdown, then Save draft
    UI->>CF: POST /api/blog/posts {title, content, author}
    CF->>API: POST /posts (+ x-origin-secret)
    API->>DB: UpdateItem counter id=0, ADD next_id 1
    DB-->>API: next_id = 7
    API->>DB: PutItem {id: 7, status: draft, ...}
    API-->>UI: 201 Post 7 (draft)

    Author->>UI: Edit, then Save changes
    UI->>CF: PATCH /api/blog/posts/7 {content}
    CF->>API: PATCH /posts/7
    API->>DB: UpdateItem SET content, updated_at (only if it exists)
    API-->>UI: 200 Post 7

    Author->>UI: Publish
    UI->>CF: POST /api/blog/posts/7/publish
    CF->>API: POST /posts/7/publish
    API->>DB: UpdateItem SET status=published, published_at=now
    API-->>UI: 200 Post 7 (published)

    Author->>UI: Delete, then confirm
    UI->>CF: DELETE /api/blog/posts/7
    CF->>API: DELETE /posts/7
    API->>DB: DeleteItem id=7 (only if it exists)
    API-->>UI: 204 No Content
    UI-->>Author: Back to the post list
